# CLI Commands

All binaries are in `./bin/` — build with `make build` before use.

## catalog-bundle-inspect

Inspect OLM catalog bundles, resolve channel heads, extract commit/version metadata.

```bash
./bin/catalog-bundle-inspect \
  --catalog <catalog-image> \
  --package <package-name> \
  [--channel <channel>] \
  [--version <version>] \
  [--json] \
  [--timeout 10m]
```

**Must-gather mode** (alternative):
```bash
./bin/catalog-bundle-inspect \
  --must-gather <path> \
  --package <name> \
  [--health-check] \
  [--environment lab|production|disconnected|kvm] \
  [--rca] [--rca-file <path>] \
  [--json]
```

## batch-validate

Validate multiple operators from a catalog index.

```bash
CATALOG=<catalog-image> LIST=<operator-list-file> ./bin/batch-validate
```

The list file contains one package name per line. Results are classified as OK, PARTIAL, or FAIL.

## telco-diagnose

Production diagnosis of the telco operator suite (27 OLM + IDMS).

```bash
./bin/telco-diagnose \
  --must-gather <path> \
  [--environment lab|production|disconnected|kvm] \
  [--catalog <catalog-image>] \
  [--cluster-name <name>] \
  [--rca-file <output-path>] \
  [--state-dir <dir>] \
  [--json]
```

Runs 20-dimension OLM health checks + 13 infrastructure dimensions per operator. Generates shareable RCA markdown reports.

## opm-diagnose

Unified diagnostics — supports both live cluster (kubeconfig) and must-gather modes.

```bash
./bin/opm-diagnose \
  --must-gather <path> \
  --package <name> \
  [--kubeconfig <path>] [--context <name>] \
  [--adhd] [--frames 5] [--depth 3] \
  [--rag] [--rag-config rag-config.yaml] \
  [--learning] [--metadata-dir <dir>] \
  [--repo-correlation] [--github-token <token>] \
  [--environment lab|production|disconnected|kvm] \
  [--rca] [--rca-file <path>] \
  [--json]
```

Full-featured: ADHD divergent analysis, RAG knowledge base, self-learning, repo correlation, session continuity.

## RAG CLIs

```bash
./bin/ocp-rag-ingest --config rag-config.yaml
./bin/ocp-rag-query --config rag-config.yaml --collection docs "search query" [--json]
./bin/ocp-rag-server --config rag-config.yaml
```

## Environment Variables

| Variable | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `DOCKER_CONFIG` | Registry auth directory (contains config.json) |
| `REGISTRY_AUTH_FILE` | Alternative registry credentials file |
| `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` | Claude API key (for ADHD and code analysis) |
| `GH_TOKEN` / `GITHUB_TOKEN` | GitHub API (for repo correlation and issue search) |
